      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3426,
      "text": "So glory be to Allah in the evening and in the morning[6],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 406,
      "ruku": 350,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3427,
      "text": "and all praise is due to Him in the heavens and earth – and [glorify Him] in the afternoon and at noon[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 406,
      "ruku": 350,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3428,
      "text": "He brings the living out of the dead and the dead out of the living, and gives life to the earth after its death. This is how you will be brought forth[8].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 406,
      "ruku": 350,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3429,
      "text": "Among His signs is that He created you from dust, then you became human beings spreading [on the earth].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 406,
      "ruku": 351,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3430,
      "text": "And among His signs is that He created for you spouses from among yourselves that you may find comfort in them, and He placed between you love and mercy. Indeed, there are signs in this for people who reflect.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 406,
      "ruku": 351,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3431,
      "text": "And among His signs is the creation of the heavens and earth, and the diversity of your tongues and colors. Indeed, there are signs in this for those who have knowledge.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 406,
      "ruku": 351,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3432,
      "text": "And among His signs is your sleep by night and day, and your seeking of His bounty [by day]. Indeed, there are signs in this for people who listen.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 30,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الرُّومِ",
        "englishName": "Ar-Room",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Romans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 406,
      "ruku": 351,
      "hizbQuarter": 162,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3433,
      "text": "And among His signs is that He shows you lightning, causing fear and hope[9], and He sends down water from the sky, reviving therewith the earth after its death. Indeed, there are signs in this for people who understand.",
      "surah": {
